        "description": "Header for section 1 of disclosure"
    },
    "disclosureSection1Body": "When you record a response, your audio is sent to a speech recognition service to generate a text transcript. That transcript is then sent to a language model to produce the next interview question and coaching feedback. A text-to-speech service converts the question text back into audio so you can hear it.",
