        "description": "Header for section 2 of disclosure"
    },
    "disclosureSection2Body": "Third-party AI services handle speech recognition (STT), question and feedback generation (LLM), and voice output (TTS). These services process your data to deliver the interview experience. VoiceMock does not train models on your data.",
